    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:RepliSplit,born:2026-08-05,wire:no wire — a bare source and mirror in one world,desc:the spine locates itself — many to one stays many — an undeclared mainkey splits visibly and never silently merges
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:RepliShadow,born:2026-08-05,wire:no wire — a bare source and mirror in one world,desc:the seem experiment — identity observed from a sent-shadow with no schema — a shadowless negative control splits beside it
