        Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:MusuGenerateTestsMusic,needsFSA:1,unusual:a once-only utility script dressed as a Book — renders the pure-tone testsounds/ collection that MusuReap and the Ra Books stock from — never swept — its old last-run date means nothing,desc:Musu_gen_testsounds writes each Artist - Title.wav (freq = the track's label) into testsounds/
