      What:replication,desc:the wire protocol itself — offers husks wants pages and crush proven on FLAT shelves — flat stays prod-legal for quarantines and strays but the canonical friend mirror is now the paged Mag of the wire cut
        Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:MusuBounce,needMusic:1,unusual:runner-killer — it wedges the runner tab and nobody knows why (Perf_todo guessed the peering standup — never diagnosed) — run only on a tab you can lose,wire:real tracks dribble over one loopback link — receiver skips,doc:Radio_todo — Clerkdesk_todo (left a runner wedged),desc:the only Book that plays real audio through two live AudioContexts and checks what was heard against a seeded skip schedule,found:2026-10-20 last green 2026-08-06
        Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:MusuReplica,wire:repli collection browse over loopback
