    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:MusuQuarter,wire:no wire — not one byte — a Jam ledger of taste and a held library,doc:Portability_doc §6 — SoundPooling_todo,desc:the Quartermaster's propose half — Ra_quarter computes a cap-sized goal stash and mints press pull evict wants — an unchanged world mints nothing — a shifted taste shifts the stash,found:2026-10-20 recorded as a 1-step stub since birth — a new run starts at total 1 and its drive never set run.sc.total so no run ever reached the oaths — re-recorded after the drive learnt its total — then only 1 of its 4 oaths fires (an unchanged world mints nothing) — the goal order and the propose and taste-shift tallies never match what Ra_quarter makes — a real gap between the Book and the code
