  What:Boot,desc:arrival machinery — the boot permission gate and its capability honesty — the phone-arc Books pile on here
    Funkcion:StoryTimes
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:BootGateNoFSA,born:2026-08-15,wire:no wire — the boot_gate module driven directly with the picker shadowed per beat,desc:the no-picker browser gets a sentence not a dead button — plus the capable-browser negative control
  What:Athe,desc:Atheory — the next Housing — code and time become matter on each A — the toy Athe_Tank lives in Ghost/A/AtheFishTesting.g — the routines in AtheTesting.g
    Funkcion:StoryTimes
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:AthePondCode,born:2026-10-20,synapse:no synapse — the toy Athe_Tank turned by hand on the Run House,desc:an A arrives with the digest of its code — and the toy's eggs hatch on its fourth turn — one turn per step
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:AthePondSunpitPassOrder,born:2026-10-20,synapse:no synapse — three tanks with the same code turned together by hand,doc:Atheory_todo §0.2 (The Sunpit by hand — order),desc:a tank declares the order its turn takes (TheASunpit and TheAPass) — a heron that looks before the hatch comes a turn late — swapping eggs and fish changes nothing
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:AthePondSunpitFrontier,born:2026-10-20,synapse:no synapse — three heron-first tanks turned together by hand,doc:Atheory_todo §0.2 (The Sunpit by hand — the frontier),desc:a frontier taken at the start of the turn still holds the fish the heron just ate so they lay two eggs — passing over what has left makes it the same as the pass-start frontier
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:AthePondCodePush,born:2026-10-20,synapse:no synapse — the toy file announced by hand as ghostsHaunt would,doc:Atheory_todo §0.2 (CodePush),desc:a pushed file waits on the A that holds it until Story lets it through at the next step — a bystander hears nothing — two arrivals are taken in once
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:AthePondSynapseSum,born:2026-10-20,synapse:a clock synapse and a fish synapse the turn sends on — summed by count or by latest,doc:Atheory_design §1.5,desc:pulses wait until the tank moves — the fish pulse a turn sends lands at the boundary and wakes the heron next move — summed latest once or count once each
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:AthePondWakeOrder,born:2026-10-20,synapse:no synapse — four pairs of tanks woken by hand in opposite orders,doc:Atheory_design §1.6 and Atheory_todo (The first Atheory tests — candidate 3),desc:two tanks with nothing between them come out the same whichever wakes first — two sharing a name counter with no synapse to say so leak which woke first
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:AthePondSynapseOrder,born:2026-10-20,synapse:two pairs with P streaming into Q — one woken whole and one a move per Story step,doc:Atheory_design §1.5,desc:stopping between moves changes nothing — what a tank sent waits in its outbox until the boundary and both pairs come out the same
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:AthePondStream,born:2026-10-20,synapse:P with a stream axon and Q joined from it — clocks nine turns apart,doc:Atheory_design §1.8,desc:a pulse carries a fish across the boundary keeping its age (not its birth turn) — it leaves Q on its next turn
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:AthePondLoop,born:2026-10-20,synapse:streams both ways between P and Q — two pairs woken in opposite orders,doc:Atheory_design §1.8,desc:with the boundary a loop of synapses needs no order — the pairs come out the same and the first two fish go round for good
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:AthePondTurns,born:2026-10-21,synapse:one tank with a clock synapse and a TheAWas history keeping three Turns,doc:Atheory_design §1.9,desc:a Turn by hand — one per synapse woken — names its pulses and code and what changed across it (an egg laid and hatched inside one wake shows only as a fish)
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:AthePondTurnReaders,born:2026-10-21,synapse:one tank keeping two Turns with two readers on its history,doc:Atheory_design §1.9,desc:Turns drop when no reader is behind them — the slowest reader holds the history and its catching up lets all but the kept Turns drop
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:AthePondVersions,born:2026-10-21,synapse:two tanks on the toy — a second version of it kept beside the loaded one and pushed to one tank,doc:Atheory_design §1.11,desc:an A runs the version its layer holds — a push waits for the step seam — then one method name runs two versions in one heap and the House never sees the second
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:AthePondNest,born:2026-10-21,synapse:two ponds as As each with a weather and one tank standing in each with no code of its own,doc:Atheory_design §1.11,desc:a tank is served its own pond’s weather and runs its pond’s code — a version pushed to one pond reaches only the tank inside it
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:AthePondSeem,born:2026-10-21,synapse:no synapse — one tank turned by hand with a Seem over its rows and the eye regarding them,doc:Atheory_todo §0.5,desc:a Seem holds each row as a point that follows it — an egg that hatches is the same point — what another organ thinks of a point goes when it goes — rolled back to a mark and turned on the tank comes out the same
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:AthePondMerge,born:2026-10-21,synapse:no synapse — a tank forked from a mark into a sibling and both turned and handled by hand,doc:Atheory_todo §0.5,desc:a merge decided point by point against the base both sides hold — what only one side changed comes across — what both changed differently is refused with both sides said — merging again changes nothing
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:AthePondMergeHatch,born:2026-10-21,synapse:no synapse — a tank forked at turn 10 — the sibling hatches its eggs while a hand changes one egg on the other side,doc:Atheory_todo §0.5,desc:the merge hands its candidate to resolve() — an egg hatched on one side comes across as one change — a hatch against a change is refused and never leaves an egg and a fish of one name
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:AthePondStampMerge,born:2026-10-21,synapse:no synapse — two forked tanks whose fish are fed by hand on both sides — a merge policy declared as particles,doc:Atheory_todo §0.5,desc:the heard mirror as a cartoon — per key the newest stamp wins and a rider travels only with its stamp — nothing is refused where the policy speaks — merged either way it comes out the same
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:AthePondMoves,born:2026-10-21,synapse:a pond holding P streaming into Q — a Seem on the pond over both tanks with a limbo,doc:Atheory_todo §0.5,desc:a fish swimming between tanks is in neither — limbo keeps it with what hung on it — arriving it is one point that moved with its regard — what never comes back drops out of limbo
    Funkcion:Storying,of_Book:AthePondReload,born:2026-10-21,synapse:no synapse — one tank with a Seem said as text and stood again from it,doc:Atheory_todo §0.5,desc:what outlives a reload is what is particles — points and regard come back and the first walk finds nothing new — a mark that does not persist comes back folded and rolling back to it is refused
